{"version":1,"content":"<p>【iOS 移植 ㊙️】自從有了 AI 之後，以往不可能的任務都變得有可能。</p><p>近日，有開發者展示了一項重大成果，成功將 Apple 的 iOS 系統移植至 Android 旗艦智能手機 OnePlus 8T 上運行。</p><p>目前核心底層的關鍵功能已可運作，惟尚欠部份驅動程式，待技術成熟後將公開整個專案，讓其他開發者接力研究。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:24.272438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:10.600422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:19.871188+00:00","content_hash":"1282da1064dfec60529c88a30646bf0d5b09cb7b3c12fe88fcf9d20b01e1f741","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}